WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
The longest surah of the
Qur'an is named after a cow.

2
00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.740
It has 286 verses.

3
00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:09.630
Its opening sorts people
into three groups:

4
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:14.220
believers, those who reject
faith, and those who only pretend.

5
00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:18.690
Elsewhere, the Qur'an names one wrong
that Allah does not forgive in a person

6
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.770
who dies without repenting.

7
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.530
What is this wrong, and why
is it treated so seriously?

8
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.720
In this mission, you'll find out how
al-Baqarah describes true believers,

9
00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.600
and the blessings of belief.

10
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:35.330
Then you'll explore how Muslims live
alongside people of other faiths today.

11
00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:39.340
Your mission: discover which
wrong the Qur'an calls the worst,

12
00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.250
and why it matters so much.
